9/section/47">47.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/47"> Search of parochial registers etc., and provision of extracts therefrom.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/part/V/crossheading/miscellaneous"> Miscellaneous</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/48">48.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/48"> Decrees of court altering status.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/49">49.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/49"> Signing by mark by persons unable to write.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/50">50.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/50"> Events occurring in institutions.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/51">51.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/51"> Returns to be made by registrar.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/52">52.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/52"> Sending of documents by post.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/53">53.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1965/49/section/53"> Offences.</a></